<title>NEW ZEALAND: Disposal boosts Asian Properties yr profit.</title>
<headline>Disposal boosts Asian Properties yr profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 19.84 vs 2.29</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 5.17 vs 3.09</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  nil vs n/a</p>
<p>    Sales revenue			     3.83 vs 4.28</p>
<p>    Abnormals, pretax			17.47 vs nil</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     2.18 vs 0.14 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Property company Asian Properties Limited said the bulk of its exceptional earnings stemmed from the sale of its one third interest in President Hotel Sdn Bhd. It also made a foreign exchange gain of $0.66 million.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
